{"4666770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Showdown of Luck", "steam_appid": 4666770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Showdown of Luck, players battle by spinning for random symbols to trigger matching card effects. Carefully combine symbols and cards to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.poster.avif?t=1778458151\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.webm?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.mp4?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each class has its own exclusive deck. Pick from hundreds of cards and events, gear up, and face the lucky battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.poster.avif?t=1778458151\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.webm?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.mp4?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Showdown</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head against all players on the leaderboard in a test of strategy and luck. The choice to strike with a one-hit kill or play it slow and steady is yours. Every battle is a completely new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn't gambling — it's a game of probability!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-futuristic art style built with pixel voxels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique slot machine symbol-triggered card effect gameplay, blending strategy and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class boasts numerous exclusive and common cards. Combine them with different enchantment symbols to create endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 5 symbol types, 6+ symbol enchantments, 4+ classes, 100+ symbol cards, and 50+ equipment cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP auto-battler mode — compete against players worldwide.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Showdown of Luck, players battle by spinning for random symbols to trigger matching card effects. Carefully combine symbols and cards to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.poster.avif?t=1778458151\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.webm?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/a5ccee3c7a3c144dfc0930102a43e815.mp4?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each class has its own exclusive deck. Pick from hundreds of cards and events, gear up, and face the lucky battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.poster.avif?t=1778458151\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.webm?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4666770/extras/9cbdd79345fe0b5bdf13afb2366d0c4e.mp4?t=1778458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Showdown</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head against all players on the leaderboard in a test of strategy and luck. The choice to strike with a one-hit kill or play it slow and steady is yours. Every battle is a completely new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn't gambling — it's a game of probability!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-futuristic art style built with pixel voxels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique slot machine symbol-triggered card effect gameplay, blending strategy and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class boasts numerous exclusive and common cards. Combine them with different enchantment symbols to create endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 5 symbol types, 6+ symbol enchantments, 4+ classes, 100+ symbol cards, and 50+ equipment cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP auto-battler 